clouddrop (0.1.0~resolute1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Upload-only sync of ~/CloudDrop to Google Drive with the same folder
    structure; local deletes keep the Drive copy (cloud-only).
  * Resumable uploads; renames and moves mirrored without re-uploading.
  * Free Up Space by hand or automatically, with folders kept on this
    computer; frees only after Google Drive's checksum matches.
  * Desktop app (setup assistant, Home, Files, Activity, Settings), top-bar
    status icon, and GNOME Files status icons and actions.

